msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "Wird geprüft…"

#: android/app/src/main/kotlin/io/pierrotws/passel/SetupWizard.kt
msgid "Create a key"
msgstr "Schlüssel erstellen"

#: android/app/src/main/kotlin/io/pierrotws/passel/SetupWizard.kt
msgid "Create a new vault"
msgstr "Neuen Tresor erstellen"

#: android/app/src/main/kotlin/io/pierrotws/passel/SetupWizard.kt
msgid "Create a new vault there"
msgstr "Dort einen neuen Tresor erstellen"

#: android/app/src/main/kotlin/io/pierrotws/passel/SetupWizard.kt
msgid "Create the vault"
msgstr "Tresor erstellen"

#: android/app/src/main/kotlin/io/pierrotws/passel/SetupWizard.kt
msgid ""
"Download it from its repository: made with Passel, or with pass and git."
msgstr ""
"Aus seinem Repository herunterladen: erstellt mit Passel oder mit pass und "
"Git."

#: android/app/src/main/kotlin/io/pierrotws/passel/SetupWizard.kt
msgid "Download it instead"
msgstr "Stattdessen herunterladen"

#: android/app/src/main/kotlin/io/pierrotws/passel/SetupWizard.kt
msgid "Download the vault"
msgstr "Tresor herunterladen"

#: android/app/src/main/kotlin/io/pierrotws/passel/SetupWizard.kt
#: assets/ui/setup_wizard.ui
msgid "Email (optional)"
msgstr "E-Mail (optional)"

#: android/app/src/main/kotlin/io/pierrotws/passel/SetupWizard.kt
msgid "Empty: ready for a new vault"
msgstr "Leer: bereit für einen neuen Tresor"

#: android/app/src/main/kotlin/io/pierrotws/passel/SetupWizard.kt
msgid ""
"Entries are encrypted with an OpenPGP key. To open a vault made on a "
"computer, import the backup of its key (gpg --export-secret-keys --armor "
"<id>). A new vault can use a key created here."
msgstr ""
"Einträge werden mit einem OpenPGP-Schlüssel verschlüsselt. Um einen auf "
"einem Computer erstellten Tresor zu öffnen, importieren Sie die Sicherung "
"seines Schlüssels (gpg --export-secret-keys --armor <id>). Ein neuer Tresor "
"kann einen hier erstellten Schlüssel verwenden."

#: android/app/src/main/kotlin/io/pierrotws/passel/SetupWizard.kt
msgid "Found a vault"
msgstr "Tresor gefunden"

#: android/app/src/main/kotlin/io/pierrotws/passel/SetupWizard.kt
msgid "Get a key:"
msgstr "Schlüssel besorgen:"

